NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the source code in this repository, together with the
difficulty labels, item splits, cross-validation folds, and model predictions,
which are our own output.

It does NOT cover the underlying Eedi item content. The question transcriptions
in `data/items.csv` and `data/question_parsed.json`, and the figure descriptions
in `data/descriptions/`, are derived from the item images released for the
NeurIPS 2020 Education Challenge (Wang et al., 2020). Redistribution and reuse
of that derived content are governed by the terms of the original release. The
Eedi question images themselves are not redistributed here.
